OL,3,GNEWSAAll you need to know about Light
OL,4,ANight Leeds 2026 tonight
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeeds will be illuminated with light
OL,7,Fprojections, installations and
OL,8,Fperformances later, on the second and
OL,9,Ffinal evening of this year's Light
OL,10,FNight.
OL,12,FLight Night is one of the UK's largest
OL,13,Flight festivals and sees landmark
OL,14,Fbuildings lit up across two evenings.
OL,16,FThousands of people are expected to
OL,17,Fvisit the city for the event, which
OL,18,Fwill feature more than 40 artworks by
OL,19,Fartists working in Leeds, as well as
OL,20,Felsewhere in the UK and
OL,21,Finternationally.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
